# OpenAI API Key for podcast generation
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# IMPORTANT: After creating/updating this file, restart your dev server!
#   Development: Stop the dev server (Ctrl+C) and run `npm run dev` again
#   Production: Restart your service (e.g., `sudo systemctl restart arandor.service`)
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# Optional: Custom uploads directory (defaults to /srv/arandor/uploads in production)
# UPLOADS_DIR=/custom/path/to/uploads
